@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam roundCorner 14

start
:Frames of a log file or of an adapter;
if (how do the frames arrive?) then (one by one:
replay, simulation, live)
  :One frame at a time
  (RealtimeEngine.process_frame);
  :Update the window
  of its identifier;
  :Timing layer
  Payload layer
  Model layer (score of the identifier);
  :Fused score
  0.35 timing + 0.35 payload
  + 0.20 model + 0.10 persistence;
  if (fused score >= 0.40
  and cooldown over?) then (yes)
    :Alert, severity LOW,
    MEDIUM, HIGH or CRITICAL;
  else (no)
  endif
else (whole file:
offline analysis)
  :Whole recording, features
  per identifier in time order;
  :Score every frame with the
  model of its identifier;
  :Flagged (score > 0.5)
  or unresolved, with its reason;
  :Timing fingerprint, patterns,
  whitelist, correlation;
  :Merge bursts
  (8 alerts on one identifier in 2 s);
  :Alerts, severity WARNING,
  HIGH or CRITICAL;
endif
stop
@enduml
